e nomination. | Courtesy photos","target":"https://s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/assets.eastidahonews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/summers-anderson-newton-pic.jpg","line":12,"embedded":true},{"title":"SUBMIT A CORRECTION","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/submit-a-correction/?headline=Incumbent%20Jefferson%20County%20coroner%20facing%20two%20challengers%20in%20the%20upcoming%20primary&url=https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/04/incumbent-jefferson-county-coroner-facing-two-challengers-in-the-upcoming-primary/","line":168},{"title":"Click here","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/eastidahonews-com-code-of-ethics/#onlinecommenting","line":170}],"metadata":{"title":"Incumbent Jefferson County coroner facing two challengers in the upcoming primary","source":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/04/incumbent-jefferson-county-coroner-facing-two-challengers-in-the-upcoming-primary/?emci=735b3d3e-8f42-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&emdi=abcbb6c5-f942-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&ceid=110103","author":["[[Rett Nelson]]"],"published":"2026-04-27","created":"2026-07-08","description":"RIGBY – Jefferson County Coroner LaVar Summers, who has served in the position since 2007, has two Republican challengers in the upcoming primary. Carl Anderson and Jim Newton are also vying for the nomination. EastIdahoNews.com sent the same eight questions to each candidate. Their unedited responses, included below, were required to be 250 words or […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},